From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Oliver Sargison <sargo@sargo.cc>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 17:08:27 +1300
Subject: [PATCH 46/81] Plutonium: incognito tabs, each in a throwaway
 off-the-record profile

createTab (the shell API and the DevTools Plutonium domain) takes
incognito: the tab opens in a new off-the-record profile of the DevTools
kind, which its page's own new tabs share. The profile is destroyed once
no tab uses it. Tabs report incognito.

EXO-INCOGNITO
